<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: acidbulb -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.label>腐蚀瘤兽</FH_Acidbulb.label>
  <!-- EN: A giant bulbous fleshbeast swollen with corrosive fluids. It tears at nearby enemies with multiple tentacles and spits corrosive acid at distant targets. -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.description>一种因腐蚀性体液而膨胀的巨型瘤状血肉兽。它会用多条触手撕扯近身敌人，并从远处喷射腐蚀性酸液。</FH_Acidbulb.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>由{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}突变而来。</FH_Acidbulb.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: Launch an acid mortar shell at long range or spray sticky acid over a target area. -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>宿主体表生长两条触手，每条造成10点钝器伤害，攻击冷却2秒。</FH_Acidbulb.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: Parasitic abilities: acid mortar and acid spray -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>触手</FH_Acidbulb.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <!-- EN: Flesh parasitism mood -6; Social Impact -10%; Toxic Resistance +100%; twisted flesh capacity +200; grants acid mortar and acid spray abilities. -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>“血肉寄生”心情-6；魅力-10%；毒抗+100%；扭曲肉容量+200；提供两条触手、“酸蚀迫击炮”和“酸液喷吐”主动能力。</FH_Acidbulb.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.tools.tentacle-0.label>触手</FH_Acidbulb.tools.tentacle-0.label>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.tools.tentacle-1.label>触手</FH_Acidbulb.tools.tentacle-1.label>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.tools.tentacle-2.label>触手</FH_Acidbulb.tools.tentacle-2.label>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.tools.tentacle-3.label>触手</FH_Acidbulb.tools.tentacle-3.label>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.tools.tentacle-4.label>触手</FH_Acidbulb.tools.tentacle-4.label>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_Acidbulb.tools.head.label>头部</FH_Acidbulb.tools.head.label>
  
  <!-- EN: bulbfreak -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.label>恶臭瘤兽</FH_Bulbfreak.label>
  <!-- EN: A horrid oozing amalgamation of many smaller fleshbeasts, all controlled by a linked nervous system. It has two large claws which it uses to tear through its victims. Bulbfreaks are often smelled before they are seen, giving off an overwhelming odor of rancid meat. They are relatively slow and easy to kill, but once they die, they explode into a horde of smaller fleshbeasts. -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.description>由许多小型血肉兽组成的可怕混合体，这些血肉兽都由同一个神经系统控制。它长着两只大爪子，可以撕碎受害者。恶臭瘤兽散发着一股令人作呕的腐臭，在看到它本体之前，往往会先闻到这种恶心的味道。它的行动相对缓慢，也很容易被消灭，死后会分裂成一群小型血肉兽。</FH_Bulbfreak.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>由{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}突变而来。</FH_Bulbfreak.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: Two tentacles deal 10 blunt damage with a 2-second cooldown. The active ability consumes 300 twisted flesh to release two random medium fleshbeasts. -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>宿主体表生长两条触手，每条造成10点钝器伤害，攻击冷却2秒。</FH_Bulbfreak.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: Parasitic weapons: tentacles and release fleshbeasts -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>触手</FH_Bulbfreak.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <!-- EN: Flesh parasitism mood -6; Social Impact -10%; Global Work Speed +20%; twisted flesh capacity +200; grants two tentacles and the release fleshbeasts ability. -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>“血肉寄生”心情-6；魅力-10%；全局工作效率+20%；扭曲肉容量+200；提供两条触手和“释放血肉兽”主动能力。</FH_Bulbfreak.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.tools.tentacle-0.label>触手</FH_Bulbfreak.tools.tentacle-0.label>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.tools.tentacle-1.label>触手</FH_Bulbfreak.tools.tentacle-1.label>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.tools.tentacle-2.label>触手</FH_Bulbfreak.tools.tentacle-2.label>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.tools.tentacle-3.label>触手</FH_Bulbfreak.tools.tentacle-3.label>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.tools.tentacle-4.label>触手</FH_Bulbfreak.tools.tentacle-4.label>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_Bulbfreak.tools.head.label>头部</FH_Bulbfreak.tools.head.label>
  
  <!-- EN: bulbplump -->
  <FH_Bulbplump.label>增生瘤兽</FH_Bulbplump.label>
  <!-- EN: A terrifying amalgamation of many smaller fleshbeasts controlled by a single nervous system. Its body is covered in explosive sacs that store energy. In combat, it detonates these sacs to propel itself rapidly toward enemies. Fresh flesh continually grows across its body and can be harvested as a resource. It is relatively slow and easy to kill, but on death it erupts violently and splits into a horde of smaller fleshbeasts. -->
  <FH_Bulbplump.description>由许多小型血肉兽组成的可怕混合体，这些血肉兽都由同一个神经系统控制。其身体上生长着许多储能的爆炸囊，在战斗中会通过爆破快速抵达敌人附近。增生瘤兽的身体会不断长出新鲜血肉，可以作为产出收集。它的行动相对缓慢，也很容易被消灭，死后会剧烈爆炸并分裂成一群小型血肉兽。</FH_Bulbplump.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Bulbplump.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>由{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}突变而来。</FH_Bulbplump.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: Two flesh tentacles strike nearby enemies for 10 blunt damage with a 2-second cooldown. -->
  <FH_Bulbplump.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>宿主体表生长两条触手，每条造成10点钝器伤害，攻击冷却2秒。</FH_Bulbplump.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: Parasitic weapon: flesh tentacles -->
  <FH_Bulbplump.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>触手</FH_Bulbplump.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <!-- EN: Flesh parasitism mood -6; Social Impact -10%; hunger rate x50%; twisted flesh capacity +400; restores 50 twisted flesh per day; grants two tentacles. -->
  <FH_Bulbplump.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>“血肉寄生”心情-6；魅力-10%；饥饿度×50%；扭曲肉容量+400；每天恢复50扭曲肉；提供两条触手。</FH_Bulbplump.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Bulbplump.tools.tentacle-0.label>触手</FH_Bulbplump.tools.tentacle-0.label>
  <!-- EN: tentacle -->
  <FH_Bulbplump.tools.tentacle-1.label>触手</FH_Bulbplump.tools.tentacle-1.label>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_Bulbplump.tools.head.label>头部</FH_Bulbplump.tools.head.label>
  
  <!-- EN: Fingerspike -->
  <FH_Fingerspike.label>独爪兽</FH_Fingerspike.label>
  <!-- EN: A fleshy dog-sized creature with a single spiked limb. Despite their short legs, fingerspikes can move remarkably fast. -->
  <FH_Fingerspike.description>长着一根带尖刺触手的血肉兽，体型与犬类动物相当。尽管独爪兽的腿很短，但移动速度非常快。</FH_Fingerspike.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Fingerspike.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>由{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}突变而来。</FH_Fingerspike.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: 宿主体表生长骨刺触手，造成刺击伤害。 -->
  <FH_Fingerspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>宿主体表生长一条骨刺触手，造成5点锐器伤害，攻击冷却2秒。</FH_Fingerspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: 寄生武器：骨刺触手 -->
  <FH_Fingerspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>骨刺触手</FH_Fingerspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <!-- EN: 全局工作效率+10%，魅力-5%，“血肉寄生”心情-6 -->
  <FH_Fingerspike.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>全局工作效率+10%；魅力-5%；“血肉寄生”心情-6；宿主生长一条骨刺触手</FH_Fingerspike.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>
  <!-- EN: spike -->
  <FH_Fingerspike.tools.spike.label>骨刺</FH_Fingerspike.tools.spike.label>
  <!-- EN: spike -->
  <FH_Fingerspike.tools.spike.labelNoLocation>骨刺</FH_Fingerspike.tools.spike.labelNoLocation>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_Fingerspike.tools.head.label>头部</FH_Fingerspike.tools.head.label>
  
  <!-- EN: Flesh replica -->
  <FH_FleshReplica.label>血肉拟像</FH_FleshReplica.label>
  <!-- EN: A humanoid fleshbeast covered in a small amount of carapace and roughly the size of an adult human. Flesh replicas can use human weapons, most of which are scavenged from the victims of fleshbeasts. After a flesh replica parasitizes a host, its original body remains independent and mimics the host's appearance. A flesh replica with a host can perform complex work just like a human. -->
  <FH_FleshReplica.description>形似人类的血肉兽，覆盖着少量甲壳，体型与成年人相当。血肉拟像可以使用人类的武器，这些武器大多是从血肉兽的受害者那里掠夺而来的。血肉拟像寄生到宿主之后本体依然会保持独立并且会模拟成宿主的外形，拥有宿主的血肉拟像可以像人类一样进行复杂工作。</FH_FleshReplica.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_FleshReplica.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>由{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}突变而来。</FH_FleshReplica.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: The flesh replica synchronizes with the host instead of living inside the host. -->
  <FH_FleshReplica.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>血肉拟像与宿主同步，而不是寄居在宿主体内。</FH_FleshReplica.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: Synchronization: flesh replica -->
  <FH_FleshReplica.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>同步：血肉拟像</FH_FleshReplica.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <!-- EN: Synchronizes with the host. The flesh replica remains active and mirrors the host's skill levels. -->
  <FH_FleshReplica.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>与宿主同步。血肉拟像会保留行动能力，并同步宿主的技能等级。</FH_FleshReplica.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>
  <!-- EN: fist -->
  <FH_FleshReplica.tools.fist.label>拳头</FH_FleshReplica.tools.fist.label>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_FleshReplica.tools.head.label>头部</FH_FleshReplica.tools.head.label>
  
  <!-- EN: fleshwind -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.label>翼爪兽</FH_Fleshwind.label>
  <!-- EN: A fleshbeast with huge spiked flying wings and a head covered in sharp keratinous plating. It is roughly the size of an adult human. Its loose, shifting structure allows it to fly through the air and quickly cross defensive fortifications. Fleshwind bodies are often host to smaller fleshbeasts; when the host dies, these parasites tear free, act independently, and attack. -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.description>一种长有巨大骨刺飞翼、头部覆盖锋利角质甲片的血肉兽，体型接近成年人。它松散而不断变形的身体结构使其能够飞越空中，迅速跨过防御工事。翼爪兽体内常寄宿着更小的血肉兽；宿主死亡后，这些寄生体会撕开躯体脱离，独立行动并发起攻击。</FH_Fleshwind.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>由{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}突变而来。</FH_Fleshwind.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: Terrain movement impedance x0; Move Speed x120% -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>地形移动阻拦系数×0；移动速度×120%</FH_Fleshwind.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>
  <!-- EN: The host ignores terrain movement penalties and has 120% Move Speed. -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>宿主无视地形移动阻拦，移动速度×120%。</FH_Fleshwind.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: Parasitic adaptation: fleshwind mobility -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>寄生适应：翼爪兽机动性</FH_Fleshwind.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <!-- EN: left wing spike -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.tools.left_wing_spike.label>左翼骨刺</FH_Fleshwind.tools.left_wing_spike.label>
  <!-- EN: wing spike -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.tools.left_wing_spike.labelNoLocation>翼骨刺</FH_Fleshwind.tools.left_wing_spike.labelNoLocation>
  <!-- EN: right wing spike -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.tools.right_wing_spike.label>右翼骨刺</FH_Fleshwind.tools.right_wing_spike.label>
  <!-- EN: wing spike -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.tools.right_wing_spike.labelNoLocation>翼骨刺</FH_Fleshwind.tools.right_wing_spike.labelNoLocation>
  <!-- EN: horned head -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.tools.horned_head.label>角质头部</FH_Fleshwind.tools.horned_head.label>
  <!-- EN: horned head -->
  <FH_Fleshwind.tools.horned_head.labelNoLocation>角质头部</FH_Fleshwind.tools.horned_head.labelNoLocation>
  
  <!-- EN: gutspike -->
  <FH_Gutspike.label>胃血兽</FH_Gutspike.label>
  <!-- EN: A small fleshbeast with a specialized stomach, roughly the size of a dog. Its stomach stores corrosive acid and rapidly compresses to spray the fluid at enemies. Its frail body is poorly suited for close combat, so gutspikes usually rely on numbers to launch ranged attacks. -->
  <FH_Gutspike.description>一只拥有胃部特化的小型血肉兽，体型与犬类动物相当。特化的胃部可以用来储存酸液，并且通过快速挤压胃部来将这些腐蚀性酸液喷吐而出。其孱弱的身体并不擅长近距离战斗，通常依靠数量优势进行远距离袭击。</FH_Gutspike.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Gutspike.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>由{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}突变而来。</FH_Gutspike.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: 喷射酸浆。 -->
  <FH_Gutspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>喷射酸浆。</FH_Gutspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: 寄生武器：酸浆喷射 -->
  <FH_Gutspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>寄生武器：酸浆喷射</FH_Gutspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <!-- EN: 食物中毒系数×0%；抗感染：肠道蠕虫；疼痛+8% -->
  <FH_Gutspike.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>食物中毒系数×0%；抗感染：肠道蠕虫；疼痛+8%</FH_Gutspike.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>
  <!-- EN: teeth -->
  <FH_Gutspike.tools.teeth.label>牙齿</FH_Gutspike.tools.teeth.label>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_Gutspike.tools.head.label>头部</FH_Gutspike.tools.head.label>
  
  <!-- EN: paraspike -->
  <FH_Paraspike.label>寄血兽</FH_Paraspike.label>
  <!-- EN: A small fleshbeast specialized for parasitism, roughly the size of a dog. It can fire a parasitic stinger into a victim, causing tiny internal wounds that continue to bleed. Each paraspike has only one stinger and soon dies after firing it. Paraspikes can also actively parasitize other animals and emerge when the host dies. -->
  <FH_Paraspike.description>一只特化了寄生能力的小型血肉兽，体型与犬类动物相当。它可以将寄生毒刺发射到受害者体内，并且持续从内部造成流血的微型伤口，但是每只寄血兽只有一枚寄生毒刺，发射之后原本的寄血兽就会很快死亡。寄血兽可以主动寄生在其他动物身上，并在宿主死亡时脱离。</FH_Paraspike.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Paraspike.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>由{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}突变而来。</FH_Paraspike.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: The host grows a bone tentacle that deals stabbing damage. -->
  <FH_Paraspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>宿主体表生长一条螺旋触手，造成5点锐器伤害，攻击冷却3秒，护甲穿透40%。</FH_Paraspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: Parasitic weapon: bone tentacle -->
  <FH_Paraspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>螺旋触手</FH_Paraspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <!-- EN: 失血速率×75%；抗感染：感染；疼痛+6%；后代继承寄血兽寄生效果 -->
  <FH_Paraspike.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>失血速率×75%；魅力-5%；抗感染：感染；疼痛+6%；宿主生长一条螺旋触手；后代继承寄血兽寄生效果</FH_Paraspike.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_Paraspike.tools.head.label>头部</FH_Paraspike.tools.head.label>
  <!-- EN: spike -->
  <FH_Paraspike.tools.spike.label>骨刺</FH_Paraspike.tools.spike.label>
  <!-- EN: spike -->
  <FH_Paraspike.tools.spike.labelNoLocation>骨刺</FH_Paraspike.tools.spike.labelNoLocation>
  
  <!-- EN: puffspike -->
  <FH_Puffspike.label>肺血兽</FH_Puffspike.label>
  <!-- EN: A small fleshbeast with specialized lungs, roughly the size of a dog. Its powerful oxygenation system allows it to move at extreme speed, but its frail body is poorly suited for combat. Puffspikes usually serve as haulers, working busily around flesh hives. -->
  <FH_Puffspike.description>一只拥有肺部特化的小型血肉兽，体型与犬类动物相当。强大的供氧系统可以使其以极快的速度移动，但是其孱弱的身体并不擅长战斗，通常作为巢穴的搬运工忙碌于血肉巢穴附近。</FH_Puffspike.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Puffspike.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>由{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}突变而来。</FH_Puffspike.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: The host gains immunity to asthma and lung rot and becomes more tolerant of toxic environments. -->
  <FH_Puffspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>宿主获得哮喘与肺瘟免疫，并更耐受毒性环境。</FH_Puffspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: Parasitic adaptation: pulmonary immunity -->
  <FH_Puffspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>寄生适应：肺部免疫</FH_Puffspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <!-- EN: 完全免疫哮喘和肺瘟，并会治愈宿主肺中的这些疾病；移动速度+10%；有毒环境抗性+30%；疼痛+6% -->
  <FH_Puffspike.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>完全免疫哮喘和肺瘟，并会治愈宿主肺中的这些疾病；移动速度+10%；有毒环境抗性+30%；疼痛+6%；扭曲肉容量+50</FH_Puffspike.comps.ParasitismComp.effect>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <FH_Puffspike.tools.head.label>头部</FH_Puffspike.tools.head.label>
  
  <!-- EN: shatterspike -->
  <FH_Shatterspike.label>碎爪兽</FH_Shatterspike.label>
  <!-- EN: A man-sized fleshbeast covered in brittle but razor-sharp bone spikes. It launches volleys of bone fragments from range, tearing targets apart with dense barrages. -->
  <FH_Shatterspike.description>一种体型接近成年人的血肉兽，躯体上遍布易碎却锋利的骨刺。它能够从远处发射成片的骨刺碎片，以密集射击撕裂目标。</FH_Shatterspike.description>
  <!-- EN: Emerged from {SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}. -->
  <FH_Shatterspike.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>由{SOURCEPAWN_labelShort}突变而来。</FH_Shatterspike.comps.CompInspectStringEmergence.inspectString>
  <!-- EN: 远程发射骨刺碎片。 -->
  <FH_Shatterspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>宿主体表生长一条碎爪触手，远程发射骨刺碎片，造成18点锐器伤害，护甲穿透100%，瞄准1秒，攻击冷却1.5秒，射程16格，弹速55，抑制能力3。</FH_Shatterspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityDescription>
  <!-- EN: 寄生武器：碎骨喷射 -->
  <FH_Shatterspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>碎爪触手</FH_Shatterspike.comps.ParasitismComp.abilityLabel>
  <!-- EN: “血肉寄生”心情-6；魅力-5% -->
