  <!-- EN: spitbulb -->
  <FH_Spitbulb.label>喷射瘤兽</FH_Spitbulb.label>
  <!-- EN: A horrid amalgamation of many smaller fleshbeasts controlled by a linked nervous system. A massive muscular launching organ grows across its body, allowing it to fire twisted lumps of flesh over extreme distances. After striking a target, each lump rapidly assembles itself into living small fleshbeasts. The spitbulb moves relatively slowly and is easy to kill, and splits into a horde of smaller fleshbeasts upon death. -->
