  <!-- EN: A terrifying amalgamation of many smaller fleshbeasts controlled by a single nervous system. Numerous pheromone-storage organs grow within its body. These pheromones stimulate nearby fleshbeasts into an active state and enhance their combat capabilities. It is relatively slow and easy to kill. On death, it erupts violently, scattering pheromones into the air to strengthen nearby entities, and splits into a horde of smaller fleshbeasts. -->
